@startuml
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> [*]
state Idle
state "Waiting for Card Insertion" as WaitingForCard
state ValidatingPIN
state "Displaying Options" as DisplayOptions
state ProcessingRequest
state Confiscating
state Ejecting

Idle --> WaitingForCard : Card Inserted / Get PIN

WaitingForCard --> ValidatingPIN : PIN Entered / Validate PIN
ValidatingPIN --> ValidatingPIN : Invalid PIN / Invalid PIN Prompt, Keep Card
ValidatingPIN --> DisplayOptions : Valid PIN / Display Menu
ValidatingPIN --> Confiscating : Third Invalid PIN, Card Stolen, Card Expired / Confiscate

DisplayOptions --> ProcessingRequest : Choice Made / Process Request
ProcessingRequest --> Ejecting : Cancel / Eject

Confiscating --> Ejecting : Card Confiscated / Display Confiscated

Ejecting --> [*] : Card Ejected / Display Ejected
@enduml
